AIP 1.0),"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with the authorization code or the pre-authorized code grant, deferred"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"issuance, batches of copies and refresh."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Presenting"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" them in answer to an "},{"code":"openid4vp:\/\/","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" request"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(OpenID4VP 1.0, HAIP 1.0), to Safari’s Digital Credentials API as an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"iOS document provider ("},{"code":"org-iso-mdoc","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", ISO\/IEC TS 18013-7), and in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"person over Bluetooth (ISO\/IEC 18013-5), where the app can also be the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reader."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The protocols run in OID4VCgo’s Go code, compiled into the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Mobile"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"framework this package links: every network request, every protocol"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"message and every check on what comes back. Your app supplies the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"platform, through three protocols: a "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeyStore","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" whose keys never leave"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the Secure Enclave, a "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialStore","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" under the device’s data"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"protection, and a "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProvider","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" that attests the wallet. It also"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"owns the UI: every session stops where the holder needs to decide."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OID4VCgo is OpenID Certified for the OpenID4VCI and OpenID4VP wallet"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"roles under HAIP, over links. The Digital Credentials API and in-person"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"presentation aren’t covered by that certification."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Start with "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GettingStarted","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", then the article for each task."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/ProximityError":{"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityError","title":"ProximityError","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ProximityError","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ProximityError","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/proximityerror","abstract":[{"text":"An in-person session failed over Bluetooth, rather than in the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"protocol (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"WalletError"},{"text":").","type":"text"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/FileCredentialStore":{"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore","title":"FileCredentialStore","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"FileCredentialStore","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"FileCredentialStore","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/filecredentialstore","abstract":[{"text":"A credential store of files: one per credential record, in a directory","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of the app’s (Application Support, by default). Records are written","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with the given file protection — complete by default: readable only","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"while the device is unlocked — and kept out of backups by default,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"since a credential is useless without its holder key, which is in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"this device’s Secure Enclave and can’t be restored elsewhere.","type":"text"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Logo":{"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Logo","title":"Logo","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Logo"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Logo"}],"abstract":[{"text":"An image the issuer names for display: an https URL or a data: image","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(nothing else reaches the app), with alternative text.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/logo"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/MdocPresentation":{"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocPresentation","title":"MdocPresentation","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MdocPresentation","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MdocPresentation","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/mdocpresentation","abstract":[{"text":"An ","type":"text"},{"code":"org-iso-mdoc","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" request (ISO\/IEC TS 18013-7 Annex C): show","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"request","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for the holder’s consent, then ","type":"text"},{"code":"respond","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" once; to decline,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"cancel the platform’s request — nothing is sent to the reader.","type":"text"}]},"https://github.com/IDFoundry/OID4VCgo":{"titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OID4VCgo"}],"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/IDFoundry\/OID4VCgo","title":"OID4VCgo","type":"link","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/IDFoundry\/OID4VCgo"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/StoreError":{"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/StoreError","title":"StoreError","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"StoreError","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"StoreError","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/storeerror","abstract":[{"text":"A store’s or provider’s own failure.","type":"text"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/OID4VC":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OID4VC"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/oid4vc","type":"topic","title":"OID4VC","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/OID4VC","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OID4VC"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"OID4VCgo’s mobile API. Every call runs off the caller’s thread: Go","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"calls block, and must never run on the main thread.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/PresentingFromALink":{"identi